   "ids": [
    "p27b3"
   ],
   "role": "other",
   "why": "after the end of the article (notice or advert)",
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Better Living"
  },
  {
   "page": 27,
   "ids": [
    "p27b4"
   ],
   "role": "subtitle",
   "why": "after the end of the article (notice or advert)",
   "words": 55,
   "text": "If you want to live like a flower you will find your way to a bed of flowers. But if your existence is replete with thorns, you will find a world full of thorny shrubs. This means that in order to lead a life in this world, finding good atmosphere is in one’s own power."
  },
  {
   "page": 27,
   "ids": [
    "p27b5"
   ],
   "role": "subtitle",
   "why": "after the end of the article (notice or advert)",
   "words": 18,
   "text": "You become friends of others and everyone will become your friend. You bear with the unpleasantness of others"
  },
  {
   "page": 27,
   "ids": [
    "p27b6"
   ],
   "role": "subtitle",
   "why": "after the end of the article (notice or advert)",
   "words": 19,
   "text": "then you will find people around you who bear with the unpleasantness from you.You benefit others and then you"
  },
  {
