   "ids": [
    "p27b7"
   ],
   "role": "subtitle",
   "why": "after the end of the article (notice or advert)",
   "words": 9,
   "text": "will find a world where everyone benefits each other."
  },
  {
   "page": 30,
   "ids": [
    "p30b5"
   ],
   "role": "other",
   "why": "after the end of the article (notice or advert)",
   "words": 5,
   "text": "The Pleasant and the Unpleasant"
  },
  {
   "page": 30,
   "ids": [
    "p30b6"
   ],
   "role": "subtitle",
   "why": "after the end of the article (notice or advert)",
   "words": 11,
   "text": "God has placed unpleasant things alongside the pleasant things of life."
  },
  {
   "page": 30,
   "ids": [
    "p30b7"
   ],
   "role": "subtitle",
   "why": "after the end of the article (notice or advert)",
   "words": 14,
   "text": "Just as the rose bush, along with its exquisite flowers, also possesses piercing thorns,"
  },
  {
   "page": 30,
   "ids": [
    "p30b8"
   ],
   "role": "subtitle",
   "why": "after the end of the article (notice or advert)",
   "words": 9,
   "text": "so also does life contain an amalgam of both"
  },
  {
   "page": 30,
   "ids": [
    "p30b9"
   ],
   "role": "subtitle",
   "why": "after the end of the article (notice or advert)",
   "words": 13,
   "text": "pleasing and displeasing objects. This is the way God has created the world."
  },
  {
   "page": 30,
   "ids": [
    "p30b10"
   ],
   "role": "subtitle",
   "why": "after the end of the article (notice or advert)",
   "words": 21,
   "text": "There is nothing for us to do but to fit in with this order of nature that He has laid down."
  },
